chapter.v:
Now it 


is superfluous, 


for me to write to you about the ministry for the saints,

Thanks be 


to God, 


for his inexpressible gift! Footnotes (1) 9:3 Or *I have sent* (2) 9:5 Greek *blessing*; twice in this verse (3) 9:5 Or *a gift expecting something in return*; Greek *greed* (4) 9:6 Greek *with blessings*; twice in this verse (5) 9:8 Or *all contentment* (6) 9:13 Or *you* (ESV)
